This product includes software originally developed by Cesar Marolla
(ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8498-7380), an interactive reference
implementation of the Risk Mechanism Theory Index (RMTI) first applied to
hepatocellular carcinoma (HCC) surveillance triage, developed for ENVR
E-241 "Risk by Design," Harvard University, Division of Continuing
Education.

